    "If a truck arrives at a customer before the customer's time window opens, does the truck wait at that customer until the window opens (with the waiting time counting toward the truck's schedule), or must the truck leave and come back later?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding how to handle early arrivals relative to time windows."
}

